  "goodToKnow": "Die Symbolik is symbolism: die Symbolik einer Geste, die Symbolik der Farben. Germany is careful with political symbolism: using Nazi symbols like the swastika is a criminal offence (§ 86a StGB), except in education, art or research. Symbolpolitik means symbolic politics, gestures without real effect. Das Symbol is a symbol, and symbolisch means symbolic. It has no plural."
